<title>POLAND: KPW clears Elektrim new share issue.</title>
<headline>KPW clears Elektrim new share issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) cleared for public trade 19 million common shares of industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim SA, the KPW said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The shares, with a nominal value of one zloty each, will be offered in exchange for the company's convertible bonds at 57,209 shares for each bond.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
